# ---- The built PDF ---------------------------------------------------
# Deliberately ignored. A PDF is a binary file: git cannot merge two
# people's versions, so committing it produces a conflict on almost every
# pull. Build it locally instead.
#
# For the four course submissions, attach the PDF to a tagged GitHub
# Release (v0.1, v0.2, v0.3, v1.0) rather than committing it. See
# COLLABORATING.md.
main.pdf

